Day22
Problem statement: Clone repository from another locally cloned repository.
Bare repository is cloned at /opt/demo.git. This repository needs to be cloned at /usr/src/barerepos/

1. Create required directory if it is not already present using below command

        mkdir -p /usr/src/barerepos/

2. Change directory using below command

        cd /usr/src/barerepos/
3. Clone required repository using below command

        git clone /opt/demo.git
4. This will clone existing repository demo.git in /usr/src/barerepos/ directory.        